From 1742fa219ac7fbdffd23cec8064e56af253d43db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: darkmaniac7 <darkmaniac7@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 20:58:46 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Backport minimal CMP compute and memory core to
 580.178.04 with lifecycle guards

CMP 170HX only (PCI 0x20C2 / 0x2082); other devices keep the stock path.
In _kgspBootGspRm(), open the FEAT/FBPA/WPR/WPR_CFG PLMs via a SEC2
post-Booter payload, write SS0/SS1 and the per-SKU FBPA_CFG1/MMU LMR memory
geometry, check that postcondition, rebuild the stock signature, refresh WPR
meta and validate the GSP FB region table before extending its reserved tail.
BAR0 PRAMIN keeps the stock offset; CE/scrubber run without VA mode or PLC.
---
